{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:27.896535+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 24.26s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('94140646afbc49ebb2f636e973b0593a', 'bed0618e1ebd4d8396710e40d1365ae0', 5475279, 1, 'Bread and Lottery', 'A vengeful Gi-hun makes a U-turn at the airport. Later, in his hideout, he intensifies his search for the elusive recruiter who is seeking new players.', '2024-12-26', 66, 8.399, 373, '/tWwP30pufZhWDSxN4qxER7gMbLR.jpg', None, 'e5451dcc4afc43939b504b8b33533501', 'bed0618e1ebd4d8396710e40d1365ae0', 5508375, 2, 'Halloween Party', 'Gi-hun finally gets hold of an invitation, marked for Halloween day. In a tense moment facing Jun-ho, they reveal their truths to each other.', '2024-12-26', 52, 7.971, 170, '/cSWW7huF9CuupMNmQlAlEHczDgk.jpg', None, '8109880cd66e4ae996062c2bc7e25af9', 'bed0618e1ebd4d8396710e40d1365ae0', 5509085, 3, '001', \"New players gather for a chance to win 45.6 billion won. After an intense first round, the survivors' fates hang in the balance — down to one final vote.\", '2024-12-26', 62, 8.2, 167, '/yL7phVQmwbBr0IVrDnqsNiPrpwQ.jpg', None, 'd6b01ae25ce3462c872252c1a8470c6b', 'bed0618e1ebd4d8396710e40d1365ae0', 5747916, 4, 'Six Legs', 'The players prepare for the next game: a six-legged pentathlon, where each team member must clear a mini-game to survive — or face collective elimination.', '2024-12-26', 63, 8.2, 152, '/o66LIyHlDTKngw2nPXcMZad2xzz.jpg', None, 'e639f08d2bbc4faea989c1c696dc58da', 'bed0618e1ebd4d8396710e40d1365ae0', 5747917, 5, 'One More Game', 'Kang No-eul earns enemies for her unruly actions. Nerves fray to the breaking point as the remaining players vote on whether to move to the next round.', '2024-12-26', 77, 8.133, 158, '/575R0zTaCUtmLjLSsBp3hLl1DQn.jpg', None, 'a7c8be7c660f4c97bdf3404b77941ed1', 'bed0618e1ebd4d8396710e40d1365ae0', 5747918, 6, 'O \\ufeff X', 'Jun-ho and his team prepare to infiltrate a suspicious island. As monetary stakes and tensions rise, players split into two opposing factions.', '2024-12-26', 53, 8.2, 142, '/uDkYBMlKZV9pr17UMjkNAeI044s.jpg', None, '50085cc44cb847abb94f8fa504542eef', 'bed0618e1ebd4d8396710e40d1365ae0', 5747919, 7, 'Friend or Foe', 'The remaining players strategize on how to survive the night. Gi-hun proposes a risky plan — but he will need trustworthy allies to carry it out.', '2024-12-26', 61, 7.777, 157, '/qZH5NZPA2N9ykpDd0dOQTmVJiVR.jpg', None)"}
