{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:28.035029+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 24.4s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('805b6c230b9f41b5b488d8670cb34d28', '29ad85dd21aa401d82d9cc71cdbb6a35', 5884550, 1, 'Keys and Knives', 'No-eul infiltrates a dangerous operation with a risky plan. A new game is announced: hide-and-seek, where one group holds a key and the other a knife.', '2025-06-27', 58, 7.9, 200, '/3sUdP791SMnEQuJNIpRCT49pkxe.jpg', None, '8de69e795b9a43c7927fd141473e4cff', '29ad85dd21aa401d82d9cc71cdbb6a35', 5884551, 2, 'The Starry Night', 'The games resume, and Gi-hun fixates on confronting Kang Dae-ho. Meanwhile, Kim Jun-hee faces a sudden crisis that pushes her willpower to its limits.', '2025-06-27', 60, 8.1, 119, '/kSyAAbk0UR8XMB4HH90x1QHqLQC.jpg', None, 'ef6efd4dd7824fb98c1b482856e0a954', '29ad85dd21aa401d82d9cc71cdbb6a35', 5884553, 3, \"It's Not Your Fault\", \"Jun-ho's team gets close to finding the island. Jang Geum-ja makes a desperate plea to Gi-hun to help Jun-hee. The VIPs discuss a cruel proposal.\", '2025-06-27', 66, 7.3, 108, '/c8W6E3MzN1t09sotXVtLVdzCsSk.jpg', None, '975ee6a1fa6c4cb2a0b3fa4d7b58341f', '29ad85dd21aa401d82d9cc71cdbb6a35', 5884554, 4, '222', 'Even as Gi-hun supports Jun-hee amid rising tensions, she must make a pivotal decision. Before the final game, the Front Man gives Gi-hun an ultimatum.', '2025-06-27', 66, 7.7, 111, '/3LLgIPSRKeddpqxvwzSGgeNkac2.jpg', None, '44b29300913b44f8a58881114a345a1f', '29ad85dd21aa401d82d9cc71cdbb6a35', 5884555, 5, '○△□', 'No-eul tries to gain the upper hand in negotiations, but her plans backfire. Gi-hun faces a moral crossroads, testing his limits — how far will he go?', '2025-06-27', 63, 7.3, 107, '/1vR55REzVaAGms1A0r10rVLS2Jj.jpg', None, '2e3d5883d40a465a84192e556d4713f0', '29ad85dd21aa401d82d9cc71cdbb6a35', 5884557, 6, 'Humans Are...', 'As Jun-ho races to reach the island, tensions peak in the final round. The last players face an impossible situation in the closing minutes of the game.', '2025-06-27', 56, 7.1, 129, '/yHXKHLQdpUdJRVDTfCuycAPSJ01.jpg', None)"}
