nspired by Jackie Kennedy and against her government's wishes, Elizabeth takes an unconventional approach to resolving an issue with Ghana.\", '2017-12-08', 57, 8.234, 47, '/nH6qhpWAuhQfPbab8Ahl2kgDACV.jpg', None, '7afd08aa04004e64b9c727312c2e4103', 'f45bbebd296940929629d33ba70a417e', 1401397, 9, 'Paterfamilias', 'Philip insists that Prince Charles attend his alma mater in Scotland and reminisces about the life-changing difficulties he experienced there.', '2017-12-08', 60, 8.064, 47, '/z96LA2f7E5BOspew99dNI30Y3pq.jpg', None, '4acb974af14f41c284a73833b5bc8b8a', 'f45bbebd296940929629d33ba70a417e', 1401398, 10, 'Mystery Man', 'A salacious government scandal hits close to home for Elizabeth and Philip. Elizabeth retreats to Scotland for rest during a difficult pregnancy.', '2017-12-08', 59, 7.886, 44, '/5dzJtIc3fhNVsjUzUPsoRRaR9dH.jpg', None)"}
