{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:28.737846+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 25.1s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('e44733c9ad9b4bef8e023a30a24be8c3', 'c33782c63a2f4921a8e1adb9ce729b57', 2396640, 1, 'Gold Stick', \"As Elizabeth welcomes Britain's first woman prime minister and Charles meets a young Diana Spencer, an IRA attack brings tragedy to the royal family.\", '2020-11-15', 54, 7.778, 36, '/4vH4qPDyaeItQXL1icQiSTvsfMt.jpg', None, 'e3da92bd22844fa3b5a7f95b83b5e1eb', 'c33782c63a2f4921a8e1adb9ce729b57', 2506843, 2, 'The Balmoral Test', 'Margaret Thatcher visits Balmoral but has trouble fitting in with the royal family, while Charles finds himself torn between his heart and family duty.', '2020-11-15', 57, 8.034, 29, '/4cpeb7xLzrLAlmEIo5XFcUTkYLq.jpg', None, '6a17013eefde4ba9b6ed166375810b09', 'c33782c63a2f4921a8e1adb9ce729b57', 2506844, 3, 'Fairytale', 'After Charles proposes, Diana moves into Buckingham Palace and finds her life filled with princess training, loneliness — and Camilla Parker Bowles.', '2020-11-15', 56, 8.267, 30, '/goLj0V05C4618bwZgTSxD3gdVEy.jpg', None, 'a6cb87040c9e4ffca89bfc14d15b1fb4', 'c33782c63a2f4921a8e1adb9ce729b57', 2506845, 4, 'Favourites', 'While Margaret Thatcher struggles with the disappearance of her favorite child, Elizabeth reexamines her relationships with her four children.', '2020-11-15', 60, 7.966, 29, '/zX2FYeoRCmvt8dFvILXV9uWMUwR.jpg', None, 'cd06d39c59814424a808e24192f24d91', 'c33782c63a2f4921a8e1adb9ce729b57' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/prZEGMkWLPYwjWmFRqbrixlasrq.jpg', None, 'aa2c8a8b9868427594ba1906e073a708', 'c33782c63a2f4921a8e1adb9ce729b57', 2506848, 7, 'The Hereditary Principle', 'Grappling with mental health issues, Margaret seeks help and discovers an appalling secret about estranged relatives of the royal family.', '2020-11-15', 50, 7.786, 28, '/7g3Pfe1Xb90h3Qao9HEbw0umWrH.jpg', None, 'aceb81dcc77d42e8871460433664950b', 'c33782c63a2f4921a8e1adb9ce729b57', 2506849, 8, '48:1', 'As many nations condemn apartheid in South Africa, tension mounts between Thatcher and Elizabeth over their clashing opinions on applying sanctions.', '2020-11-15', 53, 8.259, 27, '/sKRjSTMzoY5u4mgg6F6ckxSWXHP.jpg', None, '8c3b8227454043369f89a58be8054624', 'c33782c63a2f4921a8e1adb9ce729b57', 2506850, 9, 'Avalanche', 'Charles is caught in a deadly avalanche, prompting both him and Diana to reevaluate their commitment to their troubled marriage.', '2020-11-15', 49, 8.214, 28, '/iOoeB6YvuMvqUG7l6YwrIDYhZcd.jpg', None, 'eed975e67b684affbe9c9311177297c0', 'c33782c63a2f4921a8e1adb9ce729b57', 2506851, 10, 'War', 'Amid a growing challenge to her power, Thatcher fights for her position. Charles grows more determined to separate from Diana as their marriage unravels.', '2020-11-15', 54, 8.379, 29, '/unZvtRMoT0pVn1ztBSpkrR3gZyB.jpg', None)"}
