{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:28.886053+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 25.25s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('89be8b8643594fb3aa00a3da09f71e2f', 'cec64d7e8e9445deb740f10aa460392b', 3972378, 1, 'Queen Victoria Syndrome', \"A much-needed update to the Royal Yacht draws scrutiny to the Queen's reign. Hounded by the press, Charles and Diana have a second honeymoon in Italy.\", '2022-11-09', 56, 7.24, 25, '/yDXIMOOhm0XiMGLwjlCGNwmlM7C.jpg', None, '3d8c41e15912490d98c0277326a3777a', 'cec64d7e8e9445deb740f10aa460392b', 3972380, 2, 'The System', 'Prince Philip offers his support to a grieving family member. Keen to snatch a scoop, a tabloid journalist approaches Diana about a tell-all book.', '2022-11-09', 50, 7.154, 26, '/qGLiOFBPgwCYdRqy3TQEFgL5hRO.jpg', None, '084a5f4f5e0e4294bb1d56c3be0df921', 'cec64d7e8e9445deb740f10aa460392b', 3972381, 3, 'Mou Mou', 'In 1946, an Egyptian street vendor finds inspiration in the abdicated King Edward. Years later, he eagerly tries to integrate into British High Society.', '2022-11-09', 53, 7.478, 23, '/pljk68KfDmFUkymYNa4gk8Qx8AO.jpg', None, 'aa8b4a210bf24d3eb1f5fb76b845954f', 'cec64d7e8e9445deb740f10aa460392b', 3972382, 4, 'Annus Horribilis', 'Between a fire at Windsor Castle and tensions in her children’s marriages, the Queen commemorates and reassesses her 40 years on the throne.', '2022-11-09', 54, 7.087, 23, '/p7FTksg6W1gc9m9U4o4lR4GaTS4.jpg', None, 'ab7569ed6f29485c8af45611ece86058', 'cec64d7e8e9445deb740f10aa460392b' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/fLjqjO6qpRqrzkU32YvJBaHYdLG.jpg', None, '8b22309b042d4bc099ada9badd824710', 'cec64d7e8e9445deb740f10aa460392b', 3972385, 7, \"No Woman's Land\", \"As BBC's Martin Bashir goes to great lengths to secure an interview with Diana, the lonely princess finds purpose and warmth in a London hospital.\", '2022-11-09', 52, 6.909, 22, '/bG3yyhbU1I0GyaQAb0TbKJPhirx.jpg', None, '345e7acb48a94be29581fb358078d7b4', 'cec64d7e8e9445deb740f10aa460392b', 3972386, 8, 'Gunpowder', \"The Queen spends quality time with Prince William. On Guy Fawkes Night, fireworks make for a perfect distraction from Diana's BBC interview.\", '2022-11-09', 56, 7.286, 21, '/jaZBL2RRPElN5aNpQhHjJ7FpfN6.jpg', None, '6b5091b8c2e24f59a6592c42964a5db2', 'cec64d7e8e9445deb740f10aa460392b', 3972387, 9, 'Couple 31', 'The Princess of Wales contends with the repercussions of her statements. The Queen asks the Prime Minister for his help in a delicate family matter.', '2022-11-09', 53, 6.913, 23, '/kBQjx3xx1z6BkyH5vh3wU1CFjrw.jpg', None, '9817f99f0f9e438a96d662fdb4e10bf9', 'cec64d7e8e9445deb740f10aa460392b', 3972388, 10, 'Decommissioned', 'After heightened public scrutiny, Charles forges a new alliance in Hong Kong. Mohamed Al-Fayed offers his support to a newly-divorced Diana.', '2022-11-09', 52, 6.905, 21, '/1sQzI85NB2z4qWw5sBkUqHIC3Ag.jpg', None)"}
