{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:29.029972+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 25.39s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('b0da8008fd5b40f09be88fc6f07d2a76', '97040d99ebba4b809715e30e784d0b5b', 4718139, 1, 'Persona Non Grata', \"Diana holidays in Saint-Tropez with Al-Fayed and bonds with his son Dodi. Charles is crushed when the Queen won't attend Camilla's 50th birthday party.\", '2023-11-16', 52, 7.316, 19, '/cW2oSrAs0RaGpTiupN8MRoplkRy.jpg', None, 'f773dc402c0945ccad9c6509282fbe08', '97040d99ebba4b809715e30e784d0b5b', 4718140, 2, 'Two Photographs', 'Cameras flash and a media circus swirls as Diana and Dodi spend more time together. In retaliation, Charles stages a fatherly photo op with his sons.', '2023-11-16', 40, 6.875, 16, '/pyZO2VGBL2y3ip9VAz3dAzMBbmD.jpg', None, '1314035c18dd469b955c0f89f31fd6ef', '97040d99ebba4b809715e30e784d0b5b', 4723884, 3, 'Dis-Moi Oui', \"Dodi's father urges him to propose, but marriage is the last thing on Diana's mind. Later, a high-speed car chase with paparazzi ends in disaster.\", '2023-11-16', 57, 7.222, 18, '/fcSxydqudgtxpE1iw3qGaUgYPwH.jpg', None, '1746f62058a8439da2b5deba74b9017a', '97040d99ebba4b809715e30e784d0b5b', 4723885, 4, 'Aftermath', \"As the world mourns, the Queen's silence prompts ire and warnings from a grieving Charles. How will she rise to the occasion and mother her nation?\", '2023-11-16', 53, 7.529, 17, '/sS230ONzqu6W9Eu8G4woZ4ssYGR.jpg', None, 'cc7ea6b82e004da398a8173c357d2bbe', '97040d99ebba4b809715e30e784d0b5b' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/2iGcysv96erIGeQwEOHEgYRiEYI.jpg', None, '86b64245494a4345a74e6229ef0de998', '97040d99ebba4b809715e30e784d0b5b', 4803982, 7, 'Alma Mater', 'Now at university, William sets his eyes on Kate Middleton. With meddling parents and other prospects in the mix, how will their connection bloom?', '2023-12-14', 50, 6.467, 15, '/4Nq9OiL2mgkbvqSKqd4WAa4uA6Z.jpg', None, '69ce704e6ac444dfb1338be23300a72f', '97040d99ebba4b809715e30e784d0b5b', 4803983, 8, 'Ritz', 'After a series of strokes, a declining Margaret recalls a wild night with her sister at the Ritz in 1945, and later celebrates her 70th birthday there.', '2023-12-14', 51, 7.0, 15, '/rLm4sRnHXP2iXrMMCIjYkuVEQm4.jpg', None, '33b4a65cf6f24079ac89b1b537f9fb5a', '97040d99ebba4b809715e30e784d0b5b', 4803984, 9, 'Hope Street', 'Reeling from loss and wary of her Golden Jubilee, the Queen bonds with William, who finds his footing between normality and life in the royal limelight.', '2023-12-14', 53, 7.25, 16, '/afrbTy5CzPe7pQWrENWXWqD3d6f.jpg', None, 'c0c1e3cde07a4565978377705aece2f0', '97040d99ebba4b809715e30e784d0b5b', 4803986, 10, 'Sleep, Dearie Sleep', 'The Queen gives Charles the green light to wed Camilla. Tasked with planning her own funeral ahead of her 80th birthday, she faces an existential crisis.', '2023-12-14', 73, 7.706, 17, '/cKUtTSSWzL1rJ75m60oB1QJLpk7.jpg', None)"}
