{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:29.638971+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 26s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('da08083508fa44c89e5e2d1ff4301e8e', '7d90c4a49f8b47d4ba0cb34beadfd71f', 557315, 1, 'Human Traffic', 'When one of their own disappears while undercover, the team must work alongside LAPD on a case involving human-trafficking, money laundering and drugs.', '2010-09-21', 44, 7.375, 8, '/xVtHZ1vrhTfADiADF6MIKQiwPNn.jpg', None, '0d28d1cc556c4289ba61b7bc1b860ca1', '7d90c4a49f8b47d4ba0cb34beadfd71f', 557316, 2, 'Black Widow', 'After a mysterious hit squad takes out a Special Agent on assignment, the NCIS team jumps into action before the next target is set.', '2010-09-21', 44, 7.333, 6, '/AnABNuYu93XqFqpDs5ZS6jXg64t.jpg', None, '24284830824048bba547d9d554b69a3d', '7d90c4a49f8b47d4ba0cb34beadfd71f', 557317, 3, 'Borderline', 'The NCIS team jumps into action when video surveillance footage shows an ambush on a humvee transporting Marines in the desert. Meanwhile, Nate returns from his mystery assignment.', '2010-09-28', 44, 7.2, 5, '/8JgXZfDjIx8MUN7G8FXMEZuMoxz.jpg', None, '5c2fe79889384186a4e1bf2ae68c5880', '7d90c4a49f8b47d4ba0cb34beadfd71f', 557298, 4, 'Special Delivery', 'The team investigates the murder of a Marine who had top-level security clearance, and the corpse is missing a hand.', '2010-10-05', 42, 7.2, 5, '/eIkMewLO9YneEVJpdeSNspqIr8N.jpg', None, 'fc7f8b6066a448b2a725700a09dfc634', '7d90c4a49f8b47d4ba0cb34beadfd71f' ... 188 parameters truncated ... '/mCkFhQBgOvkYDNRmDqqdZc2Qs5D.jpg', None, '87020b5aff6045a4a6c84f79daa56422', '7d90c4a49f8b47d4ba0cb34beadfd71f', 557318, 21, 'Rocket Man', 'After a rocket engine expert is killed, NCIS tech operator Eric Beale goes undercover for the first time to ensure that the classified technology used to build satellites is safe.', '2011-04-12', 42, 7.333, 6, '/6UtT1tLP61aJ9cRVsIQ1jw1O4Hc.jpg', None, 'a9f448d6a7d04d919c216ecc20ad9d97', '7d90c4a49f8b47d4ba0cb34beadfd71f', 557319, 22, 'Plan B', 'Deeks resumes an old alias he is not fond of in order to protect his best friend and chief informant from a criminal group that wants him dead.', '2011-05-03', 44, 5.625, 8, '/p7uk7RjPBiLHB2IsZ5nDLWtI1t3.jpg', None, '43c756ccbb2542f0b667c9d9f970403a', '7d90c4a49f8b47d4ba0cb34beadfd71f', 557320, 23, 'Imposters', \"A Navy SEAL imposter's death gives the team a lead on a missing canister used to make deadly bombs.\", '2011-05-10', 44, 7.0, 6, '/6cKghLSfsMrv9aHE0A12Ds2xi3d.jpg', None, '764d4f66281a403db4b1819561bfe101', '7d90c4a49f8b47d4ba0cb34beadfd71f', 557321, 24, 'Familia', \"Hetty's sudden resignation prompts Callen and the NCIS team to investigate the reason why she would disappear in the hopes of tracking her down.\", '2011-05-17', 44, 7.833, 6, '/fix2osD2M6d0Vua04MoFjWb6x03.jpg', None)"}
