{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:29.812430+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 26.17s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('5542da2ee25b416ab14b294278259274', 'dae39b5f5d3447618b8a1b3efe4263f4', 557326, 1, 'Lange, H.', 'The Special Projects team travels to Romania to search for Hetty, while delving into the history of the Comescu crime family, and their connection to Callen.', '2011-09-20', 43, 8.0, 6, '/9MEp4ut46KEQvcjN1cAvgDMfXHp.jpg', None, '61017c7af4a94c25a6750ba685fdf158', 'dae39b5f5d3447618b8a1b3efe4263f4', 557327, 2, 'Cyber Threat', 'The NCIS team joins forces with the NSA to find the creator and controller of a software program linked to a cyber attack against the Department of Defense. Meanwhile, Callen continues searching for more information about his past.', '2011-09-27', 43, 7.2, 5, '/zTwZoXnNCB1THi5DGduOmiJgWBw.jpg', None, '5c8fae7e4e7b47a7988043e5bc0a4549', 'dae39b5f5d3447618b8a1b3efe4263f4', 557328, 3, 'Backstopped', 'Special Agent Sam Hanna is sent undercover as a bomb specialist as the team races to locate stolen explosives somewhere in the city. Meanwhile, to much protest, Hunter changes the dynamics of the team and has Callen partnered with Kensi and Sam with Deeks.', '2011-10-04', 42, 7.4, 5, '/oDY7CUpUekdSwF29TdDxrGOIvyY.jpg', None, '23f131d24f6040f6b40d3592b326a7ea', 'dae39b5f5d3447618b8a1b3efe4263f4', 557329, 4, 'Deadline', 'The NCIS team delves into the underground world of the Libyan resistance movement following the murder of a news reporter, and Hetty reveals details about Callen’s past.', '2011-10-11', 43, 7.5, 4, '/lxFTqWRWHJJ22TjbwCPhAQDHt2T.jpg', None, '780c7c64485f4dd095b3befabe73fef6', 'dae39b5f5d3447618b8a1b3efe4263f4' ... 188 parameters truncated ... '/h9YZBaXlvfhOJmbYsKCj0AOeV2M.jpg', None, '6248957c44ed4a4389fdab5ad3c86697', 'dae39b5f5d3447618b8a1b3efe4263f4', 557346, 21, 'Touch of Death (II)', 'The joint NCIS: Los Angeles and Hawaii Five-0 task force travel from Hawaii to Los Angeles, when the lead suspect in the case moves to the mainland with a deadly virus in tow.\\n\\nThe crossover starts on Hawaii Five-0 S02E21 Pa Make Loa (Touch of Death) (I).', '2012-05-01', 41, 7.4, 5, '/hxYJ8Uyi6mvx97BcT1E3flYgLSH.jpg', None, '0430c1707c1d478ca275bb59fc09dcd0', 'dae39b5f5d3447618b8a1b3efe4263f4', 557347, 22, 'Neighborhood Watch', 'Kensi and Deeks are sent undercover as married couple Melissa and Justin when evidence points to a Russian sleeper cell in a suburban neighborhood.', '2012-05-08', 43, 5.0, 6, '/8hX0Qcc2FFzYogx1IeAdJmSmqd0.jpg', None, '8381e3583fa947bba68793b3efe00a93', 'dae39b5f5d3447618b8a1b3efe4263f4', 557348, 23, 'Sans Voir (1)', 'Callen and the NCIS: LA team confront their vengeful adversary, the Chameleon, when an undercover case ignites a deadly mind game orchestrated by the criminal mastermind.', '2012-05-15', 38, 7.8, 5, '/ge7ct9yES1tGUGDitJ9AVss7QuW.jpg', None, '98a45e31f8b24a9680acea88cf17a8c5', 'dae39b5f5d3447618b8a1b3efe4263f4', 557349, 24, 'Sans Voir (2)', 'The L.A. team is drawn into a deadly mind game against a master criminal motivated by Revenge.', '2012-05-15', 41, 7.833, 6, '/nog3HoiVtyEvOthzJjDNgAWmPtp.jpg', None)"}
