{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:29.972882+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 26.34s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('e1ad2641d5e24d98ae2741be36769acb', '733643e3295948c8bdfab4654b43fb40', 557350, 1, 'Endgame', 'Following Callen’s public shooting of the Chameleon, all is not well with the NCIS: LA team, as Callen is placed on suspension and Hetty adjusts to retired life.', '2012-09-25', 44, 8.0, 5, '/dvds0KENsztA0nC5pjWwCevXfCL.jpg', None, 'c061876c8e4948e29087695f90425b54', '733643e3295948c8bdfab4654b43fb40', 557351, 2, 'Recruit', 'A drone strike on a bomb-making compound in Afghanistan reveals the body of a recently retired Marine, leaving the NCIS: LA team to investigate why the Marine returned to Afghanistan and whether or not he betrayed the country he fought for.', '2012-10-02', 44, 7.75, 4, '/11KXQdcvw3t7Kf5ae72XXyLawYM.jpg', None, 'd73e41b519ec45f6a01a746873e169cb', '733643e3295948c8bdfab4654b43fb40', 557352, 3, 'The Fifth Man', 'The NCIS: LA team investigate a compromised intel operation after four people connected to the classified project are killed at a diner explosion. As ... (16 characters truncated) ...  are on the trail of those involved, they learn that a wayward teenage girl might be related and Kensi can’t help but be empathetic to her situation.', '2012-10-09', 43, 8.0, 4, '/loLEi8J2ygMJ12vdIS7coZFhCA4.jpg', None, 'de2506e673794d7e95f48324f0ac96cd', '733643e3295948c8bdfab4654b43fb40', 557353, 4, 'Dead Body Politic', 'The NCIS: LA team investigates the tragic death of a U.S. senatorial candidate’s staffer who is run over crossing the street. The high-profile case b ... (23 characters truncated) ... onal security as the agents must determine whether it is an isolated tragic incident or a politically connected plot that might put others in danger.', '2012-10-23', 43, 7.25, 4, '/qIGFo06tzb1LW10VYBHA3XE74ZS.jpg', None, '3fe6775f916341e9b9e105ca6e6fec3d', '733643e3295948c8bdfab4654b43fb40' ... 188 parameters truncated ... '/u7uiiF5rG1ifw0p4gAlJpwTevMj.jpg', None, 'c834c7cebd29467e9f889ef5290afb3c', '733643e3295948c8bdfab4654b43fb40', 557372, 21, 'Resurrection', 'A body is stolen after a special task force successfully takes down an infamous cartel boss, leaving the NCIS: LA team to investigate the leak and track down the missing body.', '2013-04-23', 43, 7.5, 4, '/7mRsPtAHxuzNVpq6qU68SVC57E3.jpg', None, '66a0de35cac84683b091af57398517d9', '733643e3295948c8bdfab4654b43fb40', 557368, 22, 'Raven & the Swans', 'Callen questions Hetty’s motivations when a bizarre case involving a mysterious woman is revealed to be an undercover agent from her past.', '2013-04-30', 42, 7.75, 4, '/2RmQZc5ti6duNm758NeTGsvMwwQ.jpg', None, 'fe4dad05b687461ab13102161d76a3ff', '733643e3295948c8bdfab4654b43fb40', 557367, 23, 'Parley', 'Deeks goes undercover to obtain information about an infamous arms dealer looking to get back in the business, but the woman he befriends leads the operation in a dangerous directon. Meanwhile, Kensi confronts new emotions as she runs surveillance on Deeks and his female source.', '2013-05-07', 42, 7.0, 5, '/4zFjqSUuhhFn0Gr6Zpee2tV6N2a.jpg', None, '7719aa34fb0e4266a257859bf19eff97', '733643e3295948c8bdfab4654b43fb40', 557373, 24, 'Descent', 'A nuclear explosion in the Pacific reignites the search for stolen nuclear weapons and prompts Hetty to shuffle the NCIS: LA partnerships, sending Callen and Kensi overseas and leaving Sam and Deeks teamed up state side.', '2013-05-14', 44, 5.333, 6, '/xg6xVDBz7N4tp9OcZrEEZe2pWcV.jpg', None)"}
