be investigating into custody; Kensi and Deeks discuss their relationship.', '2014-04-15', 44, 5.375, 8, '/2xhOZSh5eaFZ70RZF1vqTkawXWJ.jpg', None, 'bab0a1fbefd34eb89d6b761c4ec7e437', 'd92a38b603274b6f8b5c08d7723f0392', 974657, 22, 'One More Chance', \"Sam is convinced that the theft of software for a new unmanned aerial vehicle is connected with the disappearance of the lead engineer's 10-year-old daughter, a girl Sam once provided protection detail for in Saudi Arabia.\", '2014-04-29', 41, 7.167, 6, '/se2SXgJZuly3fayRZn2dzP0DrBV.jpg', None, '2af009a0922f40ceb2492725fe05e38b', 'd92a38b603274b6f8b5c08d7723f0392', 975322, 23, 'Exposure', 'When a news reporter announces the group responsible for the deadly explosion at a military-sponsored charity event, the team must investigate her claims and search for the attacker.', '2014-05-06', 42, 7.4, 5, '/lbwtlcTF7UmVaYusSzAUjobf20L.jpg', None, '4d4f9c8a1c21461ca03c4399002625f1', 'd92a38b603274b6f8b5c08d7723f0392', 975637, 24, 'Deep Trouble (1)', \"When the NCIS: Los Angeles team and DEA uncover the cartel's plans to slyly transport billions of dollars’ worth of cocaine from Colombia to the U.S. ... (28 characters truncated) ... nd Sam must quickly locate the missing vessel. Meanwhile, Hetty is called to Washington in the aftermath of the controversial mission in Afghanistan.\", '2014-05-13', 44, 8.0, 5, '/vRqZ4K121CEqnrqzkVOHoNxVz11.jpg', None)"}
