{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:30.317920+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 26.68s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('bae17e3a41b343c2bd8c258976b51015', '8563bc57b50c4b268a95b2a1ba369bd7', 1010205, 1, 'Deep Trouble (2)', 'Callen and Sam find themselves trapped inside an armed submarine that terrorists are intending to use to hit an aircraft carrier in San Diego. Hetty goes against orders and forgoes her trip to Washington, as the team attempt  to locate and save Callen and Sam and stop the terrorist attack.', '2014-09-29', 45, 7.167, 6, '/8DKi5UA7d5UjazVILDgDriaeCMt.jpg', None, '4086dd1c74d34bc9a74d6ce74c457271', '8563bc57b50c4b268a95b2a1ba369bd7', 1010228, 2, 'Inelegant Heart', 'The NCIS: LA team find out that one of their own has been compromised as they investigate the murder of a Navy contractor involved in illegal transactions of confidential data.', '2014-10-06', 45, 7.167, 6, '/fjr3Xo1pH0ZczL9xLT7tSB7QR7z.jpg', None, 'b9438aea63174b26972b1b5520ef0e50', '8563bc57b50c4b268a95b2a1ba369bd7', 1010229, 3, 'Praesidium', 'The Department of Justice target a member of the team. Leon delivers unsettling news to Hetty.', '2014-10-13', 45, 6.857, 7, '/50A30U1ZYpbl0SrZThGsRQI2CRU.jpg', None, 'ce7124f58cd5482fbdfb75c8347aa4a9', '8563bc57b50c4b268a95b2a1ba369bd7', 1010649, 4, 'The 3rd Choir', 'The team learns that someone from their past is targeting one of their own. Nate Getz attempts to help Nell get through a traumatic experience.', '2014-10-20', 45, 6.833, 6, '/s1FgcycUH9C0XUGP6HHL2gAA2q8.jpg', None, 'f0ad7c019caa4bb7975d61fff09b017a', '8563bc57b50c4b268a95b2a1ba369bd7' ... 188 parameters truncated ... '/4aim9g8nHo9vIg17Kh1BQrYGzey.jpg', None, 'cc0fb0a2ac9f4488aad9350d8ad63588', '8563bc57b50c4b268a95b2a1ba369bd7', 1051139, 21, 'Beacon', \"Callen and Sam are shocked when an old acquaintance, who they thought was the recent victim of a murder, appears and asks for their help. As the team investigates, they uncover a possible breach of America's economic sanctions against Russia.Source: CBS\", '2015-04-20', 45, 5.75, 8, '/mQnZD7HY9Tvhv7j4kFUkSUbowZW.jpg', None, 'e4496b6c7dac4a5ca7524aca75f02fb3', '8563bc57b50c4b268a95b2a1ba369bd7', 1056491, 22, 'Field of Fire', 'The team attempt to find an expert sniper after they learn about his connection to an extremist group.', '2015-04-27', 45, 7.4, 5, '/apzbPZeBvvNevDgDu2oCcaHngD0.jpg', None, 'd42a90bfd59948d3a7e208079e8ff8a6', '8563bc57b50c4b268a95b2a1ba369bd7', 1055921, 23, 'Kolcheck, A.', \"Some presumed dead crew members show up from the missing tanker that was involved in Arkady's deal with Russia.\", '2015-05-11', 45, 8.2, 5, '/f3PMCsEf2zoyIBhhLN1VrEuvJzq.jpg', None, '407e0582209c414b97034dd5b17b88b0', '8563bc57b50c4b268a95b2a1ba369bd7', 1058184, 24, 'Chernoff, K.', 'Some of the team have to assume undercover identities in Moscow so that they can locate their suspects.', '2015-05-18', 45, 7.333, 6, '/rxRuPax5Ure0YSTyhNlg0s9zZHw.jpg', None)"}
