{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:32.486098+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 28.85s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('26a5775f837b4ec2bcd8696d13a74243', '32e5d7ac20b94990b1f53f83dc635f89', 1223145, 1, 'High-Value Target (1)', 'After NCIS fails to locate a mole in the department, Under Secretary of Defense Corbin Duggan insists on new leadership and takes over the Los Angeles unit from Hetty and Granger.', '2016-09-25', 45, 6.167, 6, '/puBRpo6Y129HoHtSlCnkmBbCjNd.jpg', None, '86273b84d8b54e348ae70d3bd3a551a9', '32e5d7ac20b94990b1f53f83dc635f89', 1223146, 2, 'Belly of the Beast (2)', 'The team travels to Syria to apprehend a High Value Target where one team member is severely injured when the mission goes awry.', '2016-09-25', 45, 8.5, 4, '/9jausAaP17lHyzhXszagC91dsTG.jpg', None, 'cd3dcfb63fba4c44802c0eb7aabceef0', '32e5d7ac20b94990b1f53f83dc635f89', 1228463, 3, \"The Queen's Gambit\", 'The NCIS LA team investigates an abduction case while down two members, with Hetty being held in D.C. for questioning, and another still in the ICU following the mission in Syria.', '2016-10-02', 45, 7.2, 5, '/lxjmuTISU7fmGt3LNusudmOtvTS.jpg', None, '636ae20be16f4f679d0e831e3561aa99', '32e5d7ac20b94990b1f53f83dc635f89', 1230260, 4, 'Black Market', 'After a Homeland Security agent is poisoned by a notorious Triad assassin, NCIS uncovers a warehouse of counterfeit purses and a money trail to stolen government funds. Also, Nell joins the team in the field.', '2016-10-16', 45, 5.857, 7, '/8Ydex5uoCnHXzOECstRaQHroBE9.jpg', None, '6765490e1e7f48c280e8cb2dd900665b', '32e5d7ac20b94990b1f53f83dc635f89' ... 188 parameters truncated ... '/lrWjxkBB13TcvN0zUVRe77KJVnK.jpg', None, 'e64d5d33b9964ae99a697eaf6dca4c84', '32e5d7ac20b94990b1f53f83dc635f89', 1298644, 21, 'Battle Scars (1)', 'After a highly decorated Navy Captain, Charles Langston, kidnaps a Veterans Affairs administrator who has been siphoning funds, the NCIS team must work with Hetty’s former Vietnam War colleagues, now-retired Admiral AJ Chegwidden and Admiral Sterling Bridges to solve the case.', '2017-04-23', 45, 6.6, 5, '/cqpIUyboV1hr9v0b7CYop32w4oE.jpg', None, 'cd92ca47e2f7451d9ca514bf2f7e754e', '32e5d7ac20b94990b1f53f83dc635f89', 1302046, 22, 'Golden Days (2)', \"A gold heist investigation has the NCIS team working with Hetty's former Vietnam War colleagues, Retired Admiral AJ Chegwidden, Admiral Sterling Bridges and Retired Captain Charles Langston.\", '2017-04-30', 45, 7.333, 3, '/e11L8PkMzj57Ti8Aeu3SywPnXWG.jpg', None, 'fc104ce938264428a6cf01d94efb801e', '32e5d7ac20b94990b1f53f83dc635f89', 1310646, 23, 'Uncaged (1)', \"After Sam's wife, Michelle, is taken from her home, the kidnappers demand the prison release of Tahir Khaled, Sam's arch nemesis, in exchange for information on her whereabouts.\", '2017-05-07', 45, 7.667, 3, '/wIoxXXBLXHQHzxgIdqGCnPdGF1m.jpg', None, 'bc1075fdc67d46e58293afa8e966b515', '32e5d7ac20b94990b1f53f83dc635f89', 1310647, 24, 'Unleashed (2)', \"Following the kidnapping of Sam's wife, Michelle Hanna, Sam goes rogue from the NCIS team and attempts to stop his arch nemesis Tahir Khaled from ever targeting his family again.\", '2017-05-14', 45, 8.667, 3, '/wuTJshCjTf7ID2CujvL1qgdmF3l.jpg', None)"}
