{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:32.823696+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 29.19s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('c307034d970b4d1c964d2201d8c7428d', '47c8cffa13124a46adfda8be0b711d29', 1356496, 1, 'Party Crashers', 'Season 9 begins with Hetty turning in retirement papers and disappearing. A new executive director arrives and immediately makes staffing changes. Meanwhile, Sam, still mourning his wife’s death, insists that Callen find a new partner.', '2017-10-01', 45, 6.25, 4, '/xzn0e3iZOXy0yaPb6MqQ7B9dXmq.jpg', None, 'b7ce4d13448c4ab3bbfef6d8ef2fcec8', '47c8cffa13124a46adfda8be0b711d29', 1367786, 2, 'Se Murio El Payaso', \"When the daughter of a notorious counterfeiter arrives in Los Angeles, Sam is sent undercover as a financier, while Callen partners with Anna to track the family's latest scheme.\", '2017-10-08', 45, 6.333, 3, '/upXtWAvFedPXuFrP9uDge3qr6sV.jpg', None, '4d215838aac64d0fa1fa3b298c95b90b', '47c8cffa13124a46adfda8be0b711d29', 1377554, 3, 'Assets', 'During the murder investigation of a Navy Lieutenant on leave in Los Angeles, the NCIS team uncovers classified surveillance briefs she smuggled into the city that may have been sold to a foreign buyer.', '2017-10-15', 45, 7.0, 3, '/xoc9ljrmqMaydxGpBAndt1cKbag.jpg', None, '8812cc74863448d586bd3d8550a569a5', '47c8cffa13124a46adfda8be0b711d29', 1377555, 4, 'Plain Sight', 'After weapons with a $1 million street value are stolen, the team tracks the evidence to a wealthy charity event, prompting Mosley to be added to the guest list with Callen and Sam as her security detail.', '2017-10-22', 45, 7.0, 3, '/s2OMCqYOHPtj4sGxjxLWOAIVmQe.jpg', None, 'ff1d6b17cd6842a796d404f7467ec24e', '47c8cffa13124a46adfda8be0b711d29' ... 188 parameters truncated ... '/dSvYl2YRaZdCWHgBmopxASmzUt9.jpg', None, '294eb60ed79445b9b95efdba7d5aadb3', '47c8cffa13124a46adfda8be0b711d29', 1472412, 21, 'Where Everybody Knows Your Name', 'NCIS partners with the FBI after a Marine is murdered by a rare nerve gas. Also, Deeks shares his dream to quit law enforcement and open a bar.', '2018-05-06', 45, 7.667, 3, '/5vZlLU6CYhmLrZuR60uWQWYOuRH.jpg', None, '9d522dcd31724c6d97c2644b67504634', '47c8cffa13124a46adfda8be0b711d29', 1473357, 22, 'Venganza', 'NCIS investigates the murder of a federal prison inmate who was the adopted daughter of a notorious counterfeiter. Also, Callen is summoned by the Alcohol, Tobacco and Firearms (ATF) Internal Affairs board to discuss Anna Kolcheck’s actions during a joint NCIS and ATF case.', '2018-05-13', 45, 7.0, 3, '/jWsxi7NDJFdwyWZpukbcvvbNGzH.jpg', None, '715e4231633d471f9a969258dd458dba', '47c8cffa13124a46adfda8be0b711d29', 1477394, 23, 'A Line in the Sand', \"After Sam is shot during a firefight with the cartel, a suspect is interrogated and reveals new information on the whereabouts of Spencer Williams, the man who kidnapped Mosley's son five years ago.\", '2018-05-20', 45, 7.0, 3, '/vZPo045AlXnumV0vOUW2bBbdfxb.jpg', None, '76dfd04dee2b47f6afe06168d3511c92', '47c8cffa13124a46adfda8be0b711d29', 1477395, 24, 'Ninguna Salida', \"Despite several team members having grave reservations, NCIS travels to Mexico for a risky mission to locate and rescue Mosley's son.\", '2018-05-20', 45, 7.667, 3, '/t3VAEsNvRO86XcPJHjqH9dh4ngM.jpg', None)"}
