{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:33.577801+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 29.94s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('484f939bc5a64d97a4061e4224e63bce', '5d0dbd49147c46df8b19ee2e4d75ad6e', 2476546, 1, 'The Bear', 'When a Russian bomber goes missing while flying over U.S. soil, Callen and Sam must track it down in the desert and secure its weapons and intel before the Russians on board destroy the plane. Meanwhile, Hetty gives Nell a cryptic assignment.', '2020-11-08', 45, 7.333, 3, '/AhzrsZjzhoQqTtlzwOd9ocXVp3D.jpg', None, 'eed902183e274b7f95392def4ff5a602', '5d0dbd49147c46df8b19ee2e4d75ad6e', 2510041, 2, 'War Crimes', 'As the trial begins of a Chief Petty Officer who Callen and Sam arrested for war crimes last year, the NCIS team is called to help find the missing star witness.', '2020-11-15', 45, 7.0, 3, '/xCuyeOF0dnb6VQpYMek3T5bF5eM.jpg', None, '0ce7c7dbc78b43c18e3e737adb1fefae', '5d0dbd49147c46df8b19ee2e4d75ad6e', 2519379, 3, 'Angry Karen', \"When Nell sends Sam to meet an informant who plans to blow the whistle on a military secret, Hanna's life is in danger when the man tries to run him down and kill him. Also, Kensi and Deeks debate whether or not to buy their first house.\", '2020-11-22', 45, 7.0, 3, '/vAjgKMlTSdTDiwD7SSp1MXUoPq7.jpg', None, '183c586663684878b721cf97447877e6', '5d0dbd49147c46df8b19ee2e4d75ad6e', 2526142, 4, 'Cash Flow', 'The body of a murdered Navy reservist is found by thieves in the midst of a robbery and NCIS must work with the burglars to find the killer. Also, Kensi and Deeks struggle to decide if they are ready to make the leap and buy a house.', '2020-12-06', 45, 6.333, 3, '/oEQty1563JfKjrld7nkMDJVoaAr.jpg', None, '4da41d59b1d3467d8e02674b932e0af4', '5d0dbd49147c46df8b19ee2e4d75ad6e' ... 116 parameters truncated ... '/6JUrIW9BOWcCYALHuu7dfzD49Hv.jpg', None, 'b40fab7dc9304660ac682572b7e48dc4', '5d0dbd49147c46df8b19ee2e4d75ad6e', 2854231, 15, 'Imposter Syndrome', 'NCIS obtains a hard drive containing a realistic deep fake video of a deceased terrorist and must retrieve the dangerous technology behind it. However, when the team’s comms are highjacked during their mission, they find that one of their own has been a victim of its potential.', '2021-05-02', 45, 7.0, 3, '/plEsB6TZPZ5HcNE8n807pYKjXdx.jpg', None, '9ed89d0530b24b85909ddfce35e03137', '5d0dbd49147c46df8b19ee2e4d75ad6e', 2854232, 16, 'Signs of Change', 'When military grade technology is stolen, a deaf engineer, Sienna Marchione, who always wanted to serve her country, and the only member of her team to survive the theft, helps Kensi and NCIS track down the tech before it’s taken out of the country.', '2021-05-09', 45, 6.667, 3, '/uldg0HLI0obJVwS79IbbzyrqSu0.jpg', None, 'a07067e8b76a4e069fdc0db2c1150cc3', '5d0dbd49147c46df8b19ee2e4d75ad6e', 2854233, 17, 'Through the Looking Glass', 'When a Naval Intelligence Officer is tortured and murdered, NCIS must work with Joelle, who informs them that other CIA operatives are being killed in the same way. Also, Kensi receives a threatening postcard from David Kessler, the sociopath who is obsessed with her.', '2021-05-16', 45, 7.667, 3, '/qc7IGNAIJlx3mzw5LtdnukCZfh4.jpg', None, '0947c1f190614f7e8292b150bce90a50', '5d0dbd49147c46df8b19ee2e4d75ad6e', 2854235, 18, 'A Tale of Two Igors', 'Deeks is kidnapped by an associate of Kirkin’s in need of his help and NCIS investigates the shooting of a militarized dolphin equipped with a Russian microchip. Also, Beale makes Nell an interesting offer and Hetty returns.', '2021-05-23', 45, 7.667, 3, '/4TUB0IV9M95W9O9KiQp3MeDmCbi.jpg', None)"}
