{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:33.938517+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 30.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('ff72c38368514b67bb4e7c40d25d4842', 'd7a86be3dc2f4b0093dbce052a87af7b', 3070181, 1, 'Subject 17', 'While Callen suspects Hetty of keeping secrets about his past and Joelle surfaces in her quest to capture Katya, NCIS must track down an informant whose life is in danger. Also, Kensi and Deeks work to expand their family.', '2021-10-10', 45, 8.0, 3, '/qKJCdwdWOzy0ZKu3M4ovbqomxfA.jpg', None, '3f571909726f454ebe5fd0084c19bb16', 'd7a86be3dc2f4b0093dbce052a87af7b', 3257041, 2, 'Fukushu', 'NCIS takes the case personally when an LAPD officer’s father, a beloved elderly Japanese American veteran, is the victim of a vicious hate crime.', '2021-10-17', 45, 5.5, 4, '/5bAnmBCdYe5X2uEqUKbEYAIhZ6L.jpg', None, '755b5aba1a5d4f7882a470918d07f4fd', 'd7a86be3dc2f4b0093dbce052a87af7b', 3257043, 3, 'Indentured', 'Sam and Kilbride clash when a case involving an arms dealer responsible for the slaughter of ATF agents leads them to a well-connected colonel and fr ... (14 characters truncated) ... de, accused of supplying militia groups with guns. Also, Kensi and Fatima go undercover at a rehab facility to question the arms dealer’s girlfriend.', '2021-10-24', 45, 6.75, 4, '/2ucapuiT2gOjjcjxNCHTVD5rbGm.jpg', None, '95b4a15d37424cfea1abe57f38a1aee5', 'd7a86be3dc2f4b0093dbce052a87af7b', 3277627, 4, 'Sorry for Your Loss', 'As Callen continues hunting Katya, Kilbride enlists NCIS to help find a truckload of stolen guns. The assignment becomes more challenging when their suspect, the son of a mob boss they believe was planning to sell them, is found dead.', '2021-10-31', 45, 7.0, 2, '/8ENnW2cntsIVp7c6FvC8eHhQwZR.jpg', None, 'd48596d3e0934241afa82290cc856a22', 'd7a86be3dc2f4b0093dbce052a87af7b' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/830PYVzRFhc79m6AmWmFeEDBjZD.jpg', None, '91df5fa35f85411cacefea3f2ba73dab', 'd7a86be3dc2f4b0093dbce052a87af7b', 3658354, 19, 'Live Free or Die Standing', 'The NCIS team works with DEA Agent Talia Del Campo to find a missing whistleblower set to testify against gun manufacturers marketing to drug cartels.', '2022-05-01', 45, 7.0, 3, '/3QQzhIbZDPEbVCWXAponYjNGXl0.jpg', None, '6522dac32de54320aca05842882e513e', 'd7a86be3dc2f4b0093dbce052a87af7b', 3700953, 20, 'Work & Family', 'NCIS investigates after two men are blown up by their own explosives while attempting to break into a military base. Also, Callen wants to take the next step with Anna, and Sam moves in with his father, Raymond.', '2022-05-08', 45, 7.0, 3, '/xAUPzpP4TECRN0BD4I07BEhvSOa.jpg', None, 'c8b41bbe46304295999f12366ee06df8', 'd7a86be3dc2f4b0093dbce052a87af7b', 3700954, 21, 'Down The Rabbit Hole', 'The NCIS team must quickly find Callen after he falls for Katya’s trap using Sam’s deepfake to coordinate a weapons deal.', '2022-05-15', 45, 7.5, 2, '/1D1h7bi1O54GxEImqXUm6vL6ppJ.jpg', None, '073a0ba008504a949acd8d62cd095e91', 'd7a86be3dc2f4b0093dbce052a87af7b', 3700956, 22, 'Come Together', 'The NCIS team hunts for a heist crew that robs a Los Angeles casino with military-grade power. Also, Kensi and Deeks hear exciting news regarding the adoption and Callen takes a big step in his relationship with Anna.', '2022-05-22', 45, 8.667, 3, '/dJMr7KKDFCMcSjrCL77xFclT7GX.jpg', None)"}
