{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:34.259787+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 30.62s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('120c41dc9eea46b9b92d01c35f2c2d28', '02e35ab8786d4d0eb00a42f4011c42d6', 3800844, 1, 'Game of Drones', 'The NCIS team searches for a suspect and their motive following the bombing of a large facility where military combat drones are assembled. Also, Callen and Kilbride get troubling news about a body found in Syria.', '2022-10-09', 43, 5.5, 2, '/m6xBJaOXis9OIRyb52ZbzeMn32f.jpg', None, 'b9eefb77c79047f2902ff2f370be3003', '02e35ab8786d4d0eb00a42f4011c42d6', 3997677, 2, 'Of Value', 'After an architect duo who specializes in designing secure buildings is kidnapped, the NCIS team mounts a search to bring them home. Also, Deeks and Kensi realize they may need to get Rosa some help with her schoolwork, and Anna considers a career outside of law enforcement.', '2022-10-16', 43, 6.0, 1, '/fEFgNNQfdawYR3dwtoFpdnqGWFL.jpg', None, 'b283c7e2d4d2474a96e577fa083e2418', '02e35ab8786d4d0eb00a42f4011c42d6', 3997678, 3, 'The Body Stitchers', 'The NCIS team join forces with the FBI when a group of grisly murderers known as “The Body Stitchers” returns after evading capture by NCIS years ago. Also, Sam’s dad makes a new friend in Arkady.', '2022-10-23', 43, 6.0, 1, '/eovvb1nw0uhLykcBZUD1uPS52uC.jpg', None, '5d738f3f40514553b7ff788d1a574bed', '02e35ab8786d4d0eb00a42f4011c42d6', 3997680, 4, 'Dead Stick', \"When Aiden Hanna's plane crashes and he is accused of being at fault for the accident, the NCIS team must investigate to clear his name; Rountree considers how he wants to handle the aftermath of the incident with the LAPD.\", '2022-10-30', 43, 6.0, 1, '/lSYz8PkfJz9VlIfQU9CzpdvhAhE.jpg', None, 'e7762a8e750c491faf2ecd26b84ee366', '02e35ab8786d4d0eb00a42f4011c42d6' ... 152 parameters truncated ... '/otPpsnoL4mDYtulbfDQGWsr26g4.jpg', None, 'b2979ebb5dcf4cf587f3828977858a0b', '02e35ab8786d4d0eb00a42f4011c42d6', 4349572, 18, 'Sensu Lato', 'The NCIS team must investigate when a Navy reservist is stabbed and his lab full of pesticides and insects is ransacked. Kilbride offers Sam the interim operations manager position. Rountree thinks about his future.', '2023-04-23', 43, 7.0, 2, '/bqnJcp9Wbf8b9aw0Cr5sLKzsoXl.jpg', None, '868b2298a4d543be96ac349b4a57e221', '02e35ab8786d4d0eb00a42f4011c42d6', 4350753, 19, 'The Reckoning', 'When four people, including a CIA officer, are shot and killed in broad daylight, the NCIS team suspects the attacks have something to do with DRONA. Also, Pembrook meets with Callen and gives more insight into his past.', '2023-05-07', 43, 6.0, 1, '/ovwgs5ILP2btNglZ3lFXyc2Tf1X.jpg', None, '5e4b1e056e6246e8906b6fe61b896332', '02e35ab8786d4d0eb00a42f4011c42d6', 4289980, 20, 'New Beginnings (1)', 'When an ATF agent goes missing, the agency seeks help from the NCIS team to investigate stolen military-grade weapons and locate the agent. Also, Cal ... (6 characters truncated) ... d Anna continue to plan their wedding, Rountree’s sister interviews for medical school, and Sam encourages his father to take part in the drug trial.', '2023-05-14', 43, 6.0, 1, '/949mpXV0vJ6628sTyYXn69kFPLS.jpg', None, '42be93e70976455abc58007d6ff8de4f', '02e35ab8786d4d0eb00a42f4011c42d6', 4289982, 21, 'New Beginnings (2)', 'The NCIS team continues the case with ATF and the stolen weapons. Also, Callen and Anna decide on an impromptu wedding.', '2023-05-21', 43, 6.0, 1, '/s7DJCSgvnCuNaMkLu5sgqWvFFtg.jpg', None)"}
