{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:34.670662+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 31.03s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('975e3e0b61a548e9bf84c8c642e18a11', 'cb829c9d0ef8438bb151f08d4daf76f7', 3971538, 1, 'Episode 1', 'A new ruling force is running London, but not everyone is happy with their methods and a rebellion is brewing.', '2022-10-20', 63, 6.8, 15, '/5CLyfcPnB2OtnEpFoqLc4kzodMA.jpg', None, '640a72be45a643cab02531eeaca8697b', 'cb829c9d0ef8438bb151f08d4daf76f7', 3994035, 2, 'Episode 2', \"Billy Wallace returns to London to seek revenge. Meanwhile, someone is picking off more of Koba's associates.\", '2022-10-20', 58, 6.6, 14, '/uTID15RknYRsXoy6fbwNA1DxrHm.jpg', None, 'dabfa572cf2648ff90ac880ef5a790e2', 'cb829c9d0ef8438bb151f08d4daf76f7', 3994043, 3, 'Episode 3', 'Marian Wallace is forced out of hiding and made to confront his past as Koba launches a terrifying helicopter attack on his enemies', '2022-10-27', 55, 5.9, 17, '/m6lvoyk4SZg5yAubjno5qi57MmT.jpg', None, '407200a150f74ac7803667163db90320', 'cb829c9d0ef8438bb151f08d4daf76f7', 3994044, 4, 'Episode 4', 'As Luan faces a desperate race against time, Ed starts to question where his own loyalties lie, and events reach an explosive climax.', '2022-11-03', 51, 6.3, 12, '/jsxmbKVjtRSEL79fegmYg8EjcYG.jpg', None, '373b9bc6ef2b4d559470b71c271f9f1e', 'cb829c9d0ef8438bb151f08d4daf76f7', 3994045, 5, 'Episode 5', 'The pieces fall into place for Elliot as he tries to free himself of the Investors once and for all, but manoeuvres elsewhere threaten to derail him.', '2022-11-10', 52, 6.8, 10, '/gvKSe308pBQhvIdwtIHURSHfDYh.jpg', None, 'a1159408c302497d8a448931fc77307a', 'cb829c9d0ef8438bb151f08d4daf76f7', 3994046, 6, 'Episode 6', 'As alliances are redrawn, Lale comes face to face with nemesis Asif and enters into a dangerous game of cat and mouse.', '2022-11-17', 48, 6.6, 13, '/6Ks4kfJEhc9LqaQqX0GEoMbX7Qo.jpg', None, 'e6f4bc3c5af5432cb972fa9c85107399', 'cb829c9d0ef8438bb151f08d4daf76f7', 3994050, 7, 'Episode 7', 'In a thrilling penultimate episode, Elliot goes after those who have wronged him, but when his plan unravels, we see what Elliot is truly capable of.', '2022-11-24', 57, 6.4, 12, '/mKrrmzPfBxwbYvhe5CwlUaPd0nC.jpg', None, 'd93e014d439d4be9bff7fda66b47f592', 'cb829c9d0ef8438bb151f08d4daf76f7', 3994051, 8, 'Episode 8', 'As the series races to a climax, who will emerge as winner in the battle for control of London?', '2022-12-01', 57, 6.0, 11, '/tn79hKgbx2Pow8LvJE7z9G63qtA.jpg', None)"}
