{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:34.821719+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 31.18s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('fb524486c3514c17b3abc3b91ad9c8ad', '61542e8617ad448d838d071745a1c826', 6019442, 1, 'Episode 1', \"When Elliot's drug shipment is spiked, rocking the Gangs and causing hundreds of deaths, the hunt is on for who is responsible.\", '2025-03-20', 49, 5.7, 20, '/y07SEETFjnkD1OHk6szR6xGYgHf.jpg', None, '3e5bbb3074744461940e9c6cf65925d7', '61542e8617ad448d838d071745a1c826', 6034355, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Sean, Billy and Cornelius make a drastic attempt to reclaim London, while Luan tries to take revenge and Elliot seeks answers.', '2025-03-27', 48, 5.5, 18, '/w4398OPdnhPcPziftyvgw5KN733.jpg', None, 'b93396d5bab24e438c240fdfc97f7afd', '61542e8617ad448d838d071745a1c826', 6034358, 3, 'Episode 3', \"Elliot's investigation puts him on a direct collision course with the Mayor. Marian decides whether to reunite with her family.\", '2025-04-03', 48, 5.0, 13, '/ms0wjjW1adAl1e3YlONZq708vzz.jpg', None, 'e5df275b28524c3bbfbe275b6f300456', '61542e8617ad448d838d071745a1c826', 6034359, 4, 'Episode 4', 'Luan takes drastic action to defend his family. Elliot uncovers a piece of the spiking mystery. But will it cost him everything?', '2025-04-10', 46, 5.2, 12, '/d0T1rxkdQDBxd9A96DRCkcQabSQ.jpg', None, '1b3340f5a0a54e009616bac02b160496', '61542e8617ad448d838d071745a1c826', 6034360, 5, 'Episode 5', 'As Lale faces a difficult choice, Asif is made an enticing offer and Marian discovers something that could impact her family.', '2025-04-17', 47, 4.8, 13, '/mRcomey7LJqnu65vSL9cRvFKHvL.jpg', None, '8c3bfbca61034b9a8ebb833306ffc74c', '61542e8617ad448d838d071745a1c826', 6034361, 6, 'Episode 6', 'A showdown between Elliot and Zeek leads to a shocking discovery. Has Elliot been looking for answers in the wrong places?', '2025-04-24', 43, 4.8, 11, '/puSi7xP2MidzXj7REzITFyOHvpr.jpg', None, '4ef5d776c8a6439480afe8e38cbf1888', '61542e8617ad448d838d071745a1c826', 6034362, 7, 'Episode 7', 'Elliot places his trust in a surprising ally to uncover the truth. Ed meets an old contact, as events build to a Gangs showdown.', '2025-05-01', 43, 4.7, 12, '/xEaz7WdtdefiOEToDZVEz4UrKzA.jpg', None, '9148db907f974e1e955a699b7d76c2ea', '61542e8617ad448d838d071745a1c826', 6034364, 8, 'Episode 8', \"The extent of the conspiracy is revealed. Elliot's past and present collide and the Gangs take revenge, changing London forever.\", '2025-05-08', 49, 4.6, 12, '/5iz5TizRs9ryHxfbnfQRGL6itAA.jpg', None)"}
