a84697a9b0bfcce20f7ed9', 'c2922d9ce9ae48a38d61214340aa8bfa', 4332953, 7, 'Mussolini', \"Agents devise a plan to see if Ray knows more than he's letting on. Sherry gives Manny news.\", '2025-04-17', 45, 5.4, 15, '/zdVmzrVKi8EFFnda775hYoY4TRo.jpg', None, '26c963d2998241fb936b3cf08b26682d', 'c2922d9ce9ae48a38d61214340aa8bfa', 4332954, 8, 'Innocent People', 'Ray comes clean and finds an unlikely ally in his search for the truth.', '2025-04-24', 50, 5.794, 17, '/iJopDWRqkWTXE2INNdza9bmQm0d.jpg', None)"}
