{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:36.567743+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 32.93s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('05b7eae55d3a4d03a6927933c97d4204', 'e450b492cc45404f846a6f648a52face', 5016404, 1, 'The Fall of the House of Usher', 'At a Congressional hearing, the story of a mysterious death at the White House, and the brilliant detective hired to crack the case, begins to unfold.', '2025-03-20', 51, 5.643, 28, '/in1kwsmowYrtDiQREYhQrmg8QZu.jpg', None, 'a3bf8db8513746d280fc3c871e84b0b3', 'e450b492cc45404f846a6f648a52face', 5824335, 2, 'Dial M for Murder', 'From celebrities and Cabinet members to plumbers and pastry chefs, everyone is in the hot seat as Cordelia conducts interviews.', '2025-03-20', 50, 5.821, 28, '/pMEqLnX67nhpiXP6kIA0uLxDZa5.jpg', None, '7cc422adc8ee460b80aadaca70cd56a4', 'e450b492cc45404f846a6f648a52face', 5824336, 3, 'Knives Out', 'Simmering conflicts in the White House kitchen offer Cordelia a delicious opportunity to uncover clues.', '2025-03-20', 51, 5.625, 24, '/n4jJO6GwlXkF2qJYC71lfRQxIh9.jpg', None, 'f8b627bd48ba48c5bb4f1d8ab5bb4af9', 'e450b492cc45404f846a6f648a52face', 5824337, 4, 'The Last of Sheila', \"Irrepressible butler Sheila has risen from Waffle House to the White House. But her misbehavior at the state dinner arouses Cordelia's suspicions.\", '2025-03-20', 55, 5.522, 23, '/2BtktXMi57kIXfGyxXMLuBdWVEr.jpg', None, '91d638247972434ea012fe36cce2114c', 'e450b492cc45404f846a6f648a52face', 5824338, 5, 'The Trouble with Harry', \"A surprise tip points Cordelia to three of the President's lesser-known housemates: his brother Tripp, his mother-in-law Nan and his top advisor, Harry.\", '2025-03-20', 47, 5.391, 23, '/esDbrU9caFt2v4a84OAzmFszvEJ.jpg', None, 'f67fa7bc4809443f8f81d46b0fd8d51d', 'e450b492cc45404f846a6f648a52face', 5824339, 6, 'The Third Man', \"As dawn breaks, Cordelia faces pressure to end the residence's lockdown. Meanwhile, in the present day, a fresh testimony upends the Senate hearing.\", '2025-03-20', 54, 5.708, 24, '/5SIOKeyR2aZXdwqdv8ZxVKtWVrl.jpg', None, '6658392f27ce4f81b740a442539fae0d', 'e450b492cc45404f846a6f648a52face', 5824340, 7, \"The Adventure of the Engineer's Thumb\", \"Elsyie, a housekeeper, is the most-liked employee in the residence. But Cordelia suspects there's more to her than meets the eye.\", '2025-03-20', 68, 5.783, 23, '/xFuoX6V6uykL8RGMCeK6L05DcDn.jpg', None, '8bcdca4d31924213bb9d9536c648b6e9', 'e450b492cc45404f846a6f648a52face', 5824341, 8, 'The Mystery of the Yellow Room', 'As the clock ticks down on her investigation, Cordelia is ready to reveal the murderer in the residence — even if she has to do it on the fly.', '2025-03-20', 88, 5.591, 22, '/vIq6An634kPyS0RAO69pbBUSyCa.jpg', None)"}
