{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:42.217150+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 38.58s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('f6f00c8be7664b7aa494453a5defbdef', 'e1ddbcbebc804f4a982a14d8eb50101c', 1677669, 1, '\"Will You Take My Hand?\" Bonus Scene', 'Sometime after the USS Discovery leaves Qo’noS, the former Emperor Georgiou is running the Orion cabaret. She is approached by a man pretending to be ... (5 characters truncated) ... ill, but recognized by her as being a Federation operative. He offers her a black Starfleet insignia, inviting her to join a mysterious organization.', '2018-03-23', 2, 0.0, 0, '/6taI3NN1j6ixXUk3Sj6wCCOWd6T.jpg', None, 'e45170dbecee4ae19c4913eca44afd33', 'e1ddbcbebc804f4a982a14d8eb50101c', 1745737, 2, 'Discovering Discovery: The Concepts and Casting of Star Trek: Discovery', 'Interviews with producers, writers and stars of Star Trek: Discovery about casting of the debut season.', '2018-11-13', 17, 0.0, 0, '/23Jc44psa29GJx2zHPjiPxU763M.jpg', None, '39d134f46d954ca2b16ff17209a5c71a', 'e1ddbcbebc804f4a982a14d8eb50101c', 1745738, 3, 'Standing In The Shadow of Giants: Creating The Sound of Discovery', 'A discussion with executive producer Alex Kurtzman and composer Jeff Russo about creating the Discovery theme and score for the show.', '2018-11-15', 8, 0.0, 0, '/5EnNWWw7ByzKjakXdm0OMHinAx2.jpg', None, 'f27116c306d74d35918cf7ae38cf6df1', 'e1ddbcbebc804f4a982a14d8eb50101c', 1745739, 4, 'Creature Comforts', 'A behind-the-scenes look at the makeup and prosthetics department on Star Trek: Discovery, as they both modernize well-known Star Trek species like the Klingons, Vulcans and the Andorians, and bring to life a new species, the Kelpiens.', '2018-11-18', 16, 0.0, 0, '/lThreEFfQW4Iz8cKRA300kF50PI.jpg', None, 'b67a9d3b1bc64a3ca7affba22cf154cf', 'e1ddbcbebc804f4a982a14d8eb50101c' ... 752 parameters truncated ... '/A4yD9JJ7OYB1VP6dVaCLWT23YkB.jpg', None, '3471a8d28df14a0989fc4b17cba491bb', 'e1ddbcbebc804f4a982a14d8eb50101c', 6521872, 68, 'The Art of Discovery: Production Design', 'A pictorial slideshow presentation of the production designs as utilized throughout the entire run of the series (without accompanying spoken commentary, only with the series’ score).', '2024-08-19', 42, 0.0, 0, '/2zNCp7sX0Vs4PKmYl6Os7F5njM7.jpg', None, 'c0f7ad73f51641beb468c2b2ca202708', 'e1ddbcbebc804f4a982a14d8eb50101c', 6521874, 69, 'Series Roundtable', 'Alex Kurtzman, Sonequa Martin-Green, Doug Jones, David Ajala, Blu del Barrio, and Wilson Cruz discuss their time and involvement on the series.', '2024-08-19', 57, 0.0, 0, '/eIklpRBnT3SOokGuAqlhARC9wlN.jpg', None, '59dd4e75331d48e4a6825f07b72a8f13', 'e1ddbcbebc804f4a982a14d8eb50101c', 6654863, 70, 'Star Trek: Short Trek: The Brightest Star', \"An additional story of Saru's people, the Kelpiens, as they live on their home world of Kaminar.\", '2019-11-12', 15, 0.0, 0, '/960KNM8XzBBuIcFGjWiZxNp99t9.jpg', None, '4d5f80b3a335463db377732ff3b34ed2', 'e1ddbcbebc804f4a982a14d8eb50101c', 6654876, 71, 'Star Trek: Short Trek: Runaway', \"Tilly encounters an alien princess on board Discovery. This short is vital viewing prior to the season's two final episodes.\", '2019-11-12', 15, 0.0, 0, '/iXmvD86JUxKt00Jyr67qiEP9cjp.jpg', None)"}
