{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:45.681831+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 42.04s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('d167886a66e74b37a99414e8cb70771f', '6e9833bf5e1b48c0bc69f1031e48937b', 3972419, 1, 'I.N.A.S.I.A.L.', 'Thrown into the deep end during his first week at the CIA, rookie lawyer Owen Hendricks quickly gets in over his head when he uncovers a possible threat.', '2022-12-16', 52, 7.1, 33, '/f2AIY0huo1QJ2Imohc9qt4O6NTF.jpg', None, '20e05f69d8a84f58ad1344d0ef88f575', '6e9833bf5e1b48c0bc69f1031e48937b', 3972420, 2, 'N.L.T.S.Y.P.', 'While scrambling to learn how to navigate the high-stakes world of international espionage, Owen attempts to track down classified information on Max.', '2022-12-16', 58, 6.7, 26, '/2T4kJMKiPTrKCNep1rSUCt2T4OJ.jpg', None, 'a6083275f7a748168a3cbe8967e49e89', '6e9833bf5e1b48c0bc69f1031e48937b', 3972421, 3, 'Y.D.E.K.W.Y.D.', \"Owen's crash course in CIA protocols continues as he negotiates with Max, goes on a date with a co-worker and contends with a hostile agency employee.\", '2022-12-16', 54, 6.6, 25, '/h38ccQ1JMsB80iVKEC5qzBCR96b.jpg', None, '943a65ec1b2245fd93ee1ed3f0bba568', '6e9833bf5e1b48c0bc69f1031e48937b', 3972422, 4, 'I.Y.D.I.A.A.C.', \"When a major snag jeopardizes Max's case, Owen races to find a legal loophole — and urges her not to take matters into her own ruthless hands.\", '2022-12-16', 57, 5.852, 27, '/q7sGqHl67iBDSKrDrZBvQRPqkKD.jpg', None, '16ec7282a6c84ffabc93adb1ce1a247f', '6e9833bf5e1b48c0bc69f1031e48937b', 3972423, 5, 'T.S.L.A.Y.P.', \"Owen's plan to move on from Max suffers a setback when he's ordered back to Phoenix, where credit cards and prying eyes cause problems at work and home.\", '2022-12-16', 51, 6.6, 22, '/qBeues1AdGsYvU9tEExjSHFWnFM.jpg', None, '8d2a506241794875a74223cca6eede32', '6e9833bf5e1b48c0bc69f1031e48937b', 3972424, 6, 'I.C.I.N.C.', \"On the heels of his risky negotiations on Max's behalf, Owen faces uncomfortable questions from his colleagues — and friends — about their connection.\", '2022-12-16', 54, 6.7, 22, '/A8RlyJMbeEwOVw8pGCfT7OUhIYv.jpg', None, '0ce2012f33754edca21f3036c0d9a5a6', '6e9833bf5e1b48c0bc69f1031e48937b', 3972425, 7, 'I.M.F.T.B.S.', \"A mission to Geneva to retrieve assets from a Swiss bank account spirals into chaos for Owen and Max, while Hannah's mom pressures her for information.\", '2022-12-16', 58, 6.8, 22, '/8FfHxEfcMMHM1uBIpF5QV4DkMhX.jpg', None, '8e0d46c38cd946c6ba11064763387f7c', '6e9833bf5e1b48c0bc69f1031e48937b', 3972426, 8, 'W.T.F.I.O.H.', \"The mission with Max takes a dangerous turn as complications arise, bullets fly — and Owen's personal and professional lives collide.\", '2022-12-16', 56, 6.9, 22, '/rRRb3zC8LYsWAJH9s91J2RwXeSK.jpg', None)"}
