{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:45.843923+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 42.21s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('6df740b5c3f7492a990f88617fe2e171', '1dabfe4c23dc4b75a5c14bdb5d85f112', 5811965, 1, 'Y.N.A.H.Y.A.L.', \"After the chaos in Prague, Owen gets benched. But it's not long before he stumbles on a new case — and into a new den of spies in South Korea.\", '2025-01-30', 55, 6.4, 9, '/gqJ6vpYpwhVLCbxGJEBF1NksIX4.jpg', None, '00bcde8a28df4308a3591a0bffc141e5', '1dabfe4c23dc4b75a5c14bdb5d85f112', 5811966, 2, 'Y.A.R.A.C.O.T.D.O.P.', \"Owen becomes a human target while digging deeper into the graymail case. Nichka has major intel on a kidnapping — but it won't come for free.\", '2025-01-30', 52, 6.5, 8, '/3r0MdAuSnPwRPapPJa0X3YbLGpW.jpg', None, '0487e2b77e644d9ea091a69fddc2e869', '1dabfe4c23dc4b75a5c14bdb5d85f112', 5811967, 3, 'H.H.I.I.T.K.A.L.', 'An impromptu trip to the Middle East leads to danger. Jang Kyun takes extreme measures to get the answers he seeks.', '2025-01-30', 51, 6.5, 8, '/7V1J1bY9rxEioSZGIavD3az7KsN.jpg', None, 'c1aecf071cc44d769974ee1091c193dd', '1dabfe4c23dc4b75a5c14bdb5d85f112', 5811968, 4, 'A.T.N.W.H.Y.P.A.B.H.', \"With no one else to trust, Owen and Jang Kyun reluctantly team up. Hannah's new romance proves risky. Oliver arranges a meeting with the yakuza.\", '2025-01-30', 56, 6.8, 8, '/xUTNZkEPk2paUW56hd86DlXfgY4.jpg', None, '01ab4e29cbe34991858410869f1c3153', '1dabfe4c23dc4b75a5c14bdb5d85f112', 5811969, 5, 'W.S.T.W.T.P.', 'Owen and his cohorts race to evade capture when the NIS orders their arrest. To save her own skin, Dawn agrees to lead a perilous mission.', '2025-01-30', 51, 6.5, 8, '/2lDPpNsYljMblnoqRuF33RD0p11.jpg', None, '283e8d27740a4ae3bd4c9af9d2147fb5', '1dabfe4c23dc4b75a5c14bdb5d85f112', 5811970, 6, 'I.D.N.W.T.B.D.I.', 'Forced to pivot when an operation goes sideways, Owen must rely on new allies, old friends and his own resourcefulness to even the odds.', '2025-01-30', 63, 6.3, 9, '/pilO9zm4aP7mI2Q1QnNb4NDqZSS.jpg', None)"}
