{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:46.263061+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 42.63s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('99a9e5a7c2194819a4403e601fa81227', '7f3f66b26187407db0ccfa72a4f38344', 3017941, 1, 'Brothers and Sisters', 'Baba ventures into hostile territory in search of Haniwa. Queen Kane consecrates a new Payan capital and makes a surprising announcement.', '2021-08-27', 62, 7.7, 29, '/AeY8Oj7n0amXU5DKFIcyVbH9bW2.jpg', None, 'eca9250f7f48450fa51ae37ea89aef5e', '7f3f66b26187407db0ccfa72a4f38344', 3019400, 2, 'Forever', 'An old enemy comes face-to-face with Baba. Jerlamarel struggles to accept a life without sight.', '2021-09-03', 60, 7.2, 25, '/d3SfstpFPRJjD0mb8osLKKYVQ1T.jpg', None, '08562a2967fd455cb10b9798cc0d4839', '7f3f66b26187407db0ccfa72a4f38344', 3019403, 3, 'The Compass', 'Edo’s leadership is called into question. Baba and Haniwa meet a secret tribe of warriors known as The Compass.', '2021-09-10', 54, 6.9, 27, '/8nfqRoYnWATomOwQFkeJT9p9kxx.jpg', None, 'f8c99e3c9b504049ab64bba85c92fc73', '7f3f66b26187407db0ccfa72a4f38344', 3019398, 4, 'The Witchfinder', 'Kofun and Toad arrive in Pennsa just as Maghra makes a life-changing decision. Baba, Paris, and Haniwa run into a trusted friend.', '2021-09-17', 46, 6.8, 25, '/nEpfNIdIY2Qmjf8weq6Gm35RdfT.jpg', None, 'e9be3b4c0d8045b7a6c3d87e29f899c4', '7f3f66b26187407db0ccfa72a4f38344', 3019399, 5, 'The Dinner Party', \"Baba and his family are finally reunited, but his joy is cut short when he learns about the queen's plans.\", '2021-09-23', 53, 7.1, 27, '/hUrDDzcx3WKjJD4o7itMuxgZ195.jpg', None, '62e55a29d44b4b609f790bb1c52abb66', '7f3f66b26187407db0ccfa72a4f38344', 3019401, 6, 'The Truth About Unicorns', \"Maghra, Lord Harlan, and Baba head to the peace summit. Haniwa warns them about Paris' vision. The queen and Kofun spend the day together.\", '2021-10-01', 58, 7.2, 23, '/vqN8j3m8tyRYfGSJCazkWm9KAya.jpg', None, 'dc45cf89fe0c43e68f6f1c56518ff83e', '7f3f66b26187407db0ccfa72a4f38344', 3019402, 7, \"The Queen's Speech\", \"Queen Kane's treachery forces Maghra's hand. Kofun gets upsetting news. Haniwa makes a final plea to Wren in a bid for peace.\", '2021-10-08', 52, 7.4, 24, '/16z9I068CbNtD9ux4etfaZXswGt.jpg', None, 'cb206d8ea3e84e68b14df9bf7e432b5d', '7f3f66b26187407db0ccfa72a4f38344', 3019404, 8, 'Rock-a-Bye', 'Baba and Edo lead their armies into an epic battle that builds to an intense face-off between the brothers.', '2021-10-14', 62, 7.8, 26, '/r5NgxarUrc2KYr8MAIacokIkU4S.jpg', None)"}
