{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:46.453508+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 42.82s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('ded61958ad984463aef08b0d9d0871c3', '5ad44116fa2e4b4aa0b6963b6e176158', 3811435, 1, 'Heavy Hangs the Head', 'Baba embraces life in the mountains as hatred for the sighted grows in Pennsa. A Trivantian scientist develops a terrifying new weapon.', '2022-08-25', 58, 6.9, 24, '/ch5fCayQtmswDBgA3OLhZVGx4QL.jpg', None, 'd2785ec029e24fe9b2b44b2b1f005cff', '5ad44116fa2e4b4aa0b6963b6e176158', 3811451, 2, 'Watch Out for Wolves', 'After a devastating loss, Baba heads to Pennsa to warn his family. Maghra debates the Witchfinders’ fate. Wren stages a daring escape.', '2022-09-01', 43, 7.0, 24, '/cCbewuCwPln4QMsMAc5NImdVIC3.jpg', None, '1c3ebb68f2024f33b83702144a57cca6', '5ad44116fa2e4b4aa0b6963b6e176158', 3811453, 3, 'This Land Is Your Land', 'Wren arrives in Pennsa and shares information about Tormada’s plans. Tamacti Jun tries once more to quell the Witchfinders’ insurgency.', '2022-09-08', 54, 6.9, 23, '/qQejB64G459Kg7ak4DARi0CR7Xw.jpg', None, '8786ec3bfdff4669802244e7fc0cd820', '5ad44116fa2e4b4aa0b6963b6e176158', 3811454, 4, 'The Storm', 'Tormada presents his new weaponry to The Triangle as Baba leads a group to the House of Enlightenment to destroy Tormada’s arsenal.', '2022-09-15', 52, 6.7, 25, '/bh9TMojjAxg94SqVxNnY4KmXhiB.jpg', None, '1764cb4dc6924b208c9809f042f40929', '5ad44116fa2e4b4aa0b6963b6e176158', 3811455, 5, 'The House of Enlightenment', 'A standoff at the House of Enlightenment gives way to a bloody siege between Baba’s party and Tormada’s soldiers.', '2022-09-22', 42, 7.3, 27, '/7P3QDiKud1YkNFncIZmwCJCiXrs.jpg', None, '39e7dc71953b40e6a5b69025fb8b7b74', '5ad44116fa2e4b4aa0b6963b6e176158', 3811456, 6, 'The Lowlands', 'Baba and his group take a dangerous shortcut through the lowlands to get to Pennsa. Maghra and Tamacti Jun make a horrifying discovery.', '2022-09-29', 48, 7.2, 28, '/bS88sDCeRRwK3aDdGaTqzp5et94.jpg', None, 'fe9fbda245e44ca380a5b9b7012ce25b', '5ad44116fa2e4b4aa0b6963b6e176158', 3811458, 7, 'God Thunder', 'Tormada and Sibeth launch a violent attack on Pennsa that puts Maghra and the city’s inhabitants in grave danger.', '2022-10-06', 55, 6.8, 28, '/i2qfTBHwvkF5IiPIx6yejvrIbyg.jpg', None, 'f5277c24fdb340f1b2a2601ce8d2b5c5', '5ad44116fa2e4b4aa0b6963b6e176158', 3811459, 8, 'I See You', 'Baba and Ranger infiltrate Sibeth’s camp, determined to stop her and Tormada once and for all.', '2022-10-13', 60, 7.364, 33, '/u4swkZb3iwKxwaEYoZGFjl3iHhB.jpg', None)"}
