{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:47.265347+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 43.63s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('43471992b945459898f208ddaa63769c', '6d969a719e484483824cae22a4ab11ca', 992962, 1, 'Reunion Special', \"Participants from Catfish: The TV Show reunite in MTV's Times Square studio to answer questions from fans. The show is hosted by Nev and Max, and Su-Chin Pak.\", '2013-02-25', 42, 0.0, 0, None, None, '33f84a3b814a4cdf96766fde659a5824', '6d969a719e484483824cae22a4ab11ca', 914149, 2, 'Hooked On Catfish: The Road To Season 2', 'Max and Nev take us behind the scenes and give us a sneak peek at what to expect when Season 2 premieres.', '2013-06-18', 42, 0.0, 0, None, None, '0c27381296c64501989089185b27d9d8', '6d969a719e484483824cae22a4ab11ca', 992968, 3, 'Chatfish Live After Show: Lauren & Derek', 'Lauren and Derek join Su-chin, Nev and Max to answer fan questions and dish on how their relationship is today.', '2013-07-16', 42, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'ea71b71e4db944ba8ab035f6b15748ff', '6d969a719e484483824cae22a4ab11ca', 992961, 4, 'Chatfish Live After Show: Dorion & Jeszica', 'Dorion, Raffinee and Alexis are all together for the first time to discuss their love triangle on the Live After Show.', '2013-07-23', 42, 0.0, 0, None, None, '3e3f0a0011744cdd86a3f8d3bda98b3a', '6d969a719e484483824cae22a4ab11ca' ... 512 parameters truncated ... '/pODuZLgqCLL0eM2fjknEhtno1L1.jpg', None, '46c90f8b9f434dbc8c3c586f1b79a315', '6d969a719e484483824cae22a4ab11ca', 2553633, 49, 'Catfish Trolls: Camyonce & Rollin’ Ray', 'Cameron is at his wits end with a wheelchair-bound troll named “Rollin’ Ray”. When Charlamagne and Raymond finally arrange a meeting between the two, tempers flare and their long-awaited confrontation becomes explosive.', '2018-07-25', 42, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'f0f215e769b145eeb32bc47c6eb3fb49', '6d969a719e484483824cae22a4ab11ca', 2553632, 50, 'Catfish Trolls: Ciera & Eskimo Jay', \"Ciera's life changes when a troll named Eskimo Jay steals her selfies and creates an offensive meme that instantly goes viral. Hurt, angry and embarrassed, Ciera teams up with Charlamagne and Raymond to confront her aggressor.\", '2018-08-01', 42, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'dcb5b510d1404423bbd669df21dfb5a5', '6d969a719e484483824cae22a4ab11ca', 3920367, 51, 'Making Waves: Ten Years of Catfish', 'From shocking reveals and twist happy endings to strange emails and countless red flags, look back on the most memorable moments in a decade of DMs on this special Catfish retrospective.', '2022-08-23', 73, 0.0, 0, '/f8xLMTfdKT2hpx9d8Hq9M7yKnVi.jpg', None, 'a625a3a8d2cb48fcbc95bdec7491b1bd', '6d969a719e484483824cae22a4ab11ca', 3923065, 52, 'Catfish: Sweet & Sour', 'Take a walk down memory lane as Catfish hosts Nev and Kamie reflect on the super sweet and shockingly sour moments they have witnessed over the years.', '2022-08-30', None, 0.0, 0, '/c9qkH0xImuoYKP7wAoOOMdHqhxn.jpg', None)"}
