{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:48.564476+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 44.93s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('f65967e55e4247f5900a24d207bdfb1d', '9aa71748361245009dd5b31beebeef8b', 5302150, 1, 'Jeni & Elijah', \"After a decade of not dating, Jeni fell hard for Elijah, but he won't meet and now his inconsistent photos of what he looks like are causing Jeni to be confused about who she's in love with.\", '2024-04-30', 42, 0.0, 0, '/ecEgHK1bHYN5wRpH5wcsX4lxkfv.jpg', None, '4ef908647a824ce68740c7482f9200b5', '9aa71748361245009dd5b31beebeef8b', 5302151, 2, 'Kay & Tyreek', \"Kay found Tyreek online while looking for a friend, and little did she know he would end up becoming her first love, but after two years of never meeting, Kay's ready for answers.\", '2024-04-30', 42, 0.0, 0, '/zM3JD9kqAckdlsPf1KIoHzhwynx.jpg', None, '7a8119edc708498bb52bf186226cabd6', '9aa71748361245009dd5b31beebeef8b', 5302152, 3, 'Mohammed & Ashley', 'Mohammed connected online with Ashley over business and spirituality. He’s developed strong feelings, but she keeps avoiding meeting up. Mohammed calls in the Catfish crew, and as soon as he shows them her photo, Nev and Kamie have upsetting news!', '2024-05-07', 42, 0.0, 0, '/hI8lMeduimGOPxKU0DeFK0DPzqK.jpg', None, '6c71de86972a462fa0687ad608818f5d', '9aa71748361245009dd5b31beebeef8b', 5316267, 4, 'Joey & Marrissa', 'The day Marrissa friended Joey was the day that changed everything for him. He thought he finally found a perfect woman but now, the only thing that has changed for Joey is his bank account, which Marrissa has almost emptied! Enter Catfish!', '2024-05-07', 42, 0.0, 0, '/h0W8BRIgKB7QroXlWZwI69ms4eG.jpg', None, '80f08527e0a0444c830d4217131b118f', '9aa71748361245009dd5b31beebeef8b' ... 80 parameters truncated ... '/wHfsKGpr5HDjORp3D1Ui6gFgrYM.jpg', None, '0fd89fb0c13a42da9572d4c835316b78', '9aa71748361245009dd5b31beebeef8b', 5371714, 12, 'Ayla & Gabby\\xa0', 'Meeting online a year ago, Ayla experienced an instant connection with Gabby, bonding over their shared sickle-cell struggles. However, with Gabby refusing to meet or video chat, Nev and Kamie feel that Gabby might not be the real soulmate.', '2024-06-25', 42, 0.0, 0, '/kbBLhS7P3XIqCsNvQSqyYwwTEII.jpg', None, 'a3ef631b468042f18ee13f82ab86a634', '9aa71748361245009dd5b31beebeef8b', 5404532, 13, 'Omar & Iris', 'Iris is stunningly beautiful and a nerd too; Omar thinks he found the perfect girl, but when Nev and Kamie arrive to help Omar, they have concerns.', '2024-07-02', 42, 0.0, 0, '/mjyVuWBRWgaTPfCYoFYjnSepwGH.jpg', None, 'b09af6d009594823a78b21d6c1a64571', '9aa71748361245009dd5b31beebeef8b', 5419062, 14, 'Sebastian & Allison', 'Sebastian talks to Allison for over three years, but she refuses to ever video chat; when he tells her he plans to move closer to her, Allison pulls back; Nev and Kamie suspect Allison hides something.', '2024-07-09', 42, 0.0, 0, '/oBjNLR0dcYBPZllbxxU8h8rPXxY.jpg', None, '1e651d152886495b8e19bf034f4524f2', '9aa71748361245009dd5b31beebeef8b', 5432360, 15, 'Reign & Piers', 'Young Reign fell fast for Piers, forming a deep connection after meeting in an anime fandom group. Now, 7 years later, after a long absence, Piers is back in her DMs! Reign enlists the help of Nev and Kamie to find Piers.', '2024-07-16', 42, 0.0, 0, '/fewq9KoJM8LGU5ZELDyqM4xPMQ5.jpg', None)"}
