{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:49.958588+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 46.32s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('6c405bb19e8043c8ad2af21bbd0fcb4d', '89002ec7445d46039ae0fb66720a3623', 5992495, 1, 'Brazil', \"In Brazil, David Blaine seeks inspiration by immersing himself in his hosts' vibrant energy, passion and spontaneity. The exceptional daredevils, artists, explorers and athletes he encounters unite to help him bring an audacious feat to life that's lingered in his dreams for years.\", '2025-03-23', 44, 6.7, 3, '/juFxNW5jqEUOawH54DKLT8DYcgV.jpg', None, 'e828103a46874706aced6490077daa8f', '89002ec7445d46039ae0fb66720a3623', 5992494, 2, 'Southeast Asia', 'In Southeast Asia, David Blaine explores fascinating relationships with wildlife and how pain endurance can transform fear into magic. He meets pract ... (29 characters truncated) ... ble by sharp objects and performers who can endure the stings of venomous creatures. David unpacks how people exploit fear in order to create wonder.', '2025-03-23', 45, 7.0, 2, '/iDpdlTcjVNSFjhmJg52KAtwVXAF.jpg', None, 'c92999294da84573a89cca3a80295e13', '89002ec7445d46039ae0fb66720a3623', 3492540, 3, 'India', 'Growing up, David Blaine was fascinated by images from India of extraordinary physical feats. This evolved into a life-long obsession with real acts  ... (96 characters truncated) ... le still perform these acts today. In India, David unearths these modern practitioners to explore how belief and performance intersect to make magic.', '2025-03-30', 42, 6.5, 2, '/b5G2edDwchtxeN49feNo5fiOiWQ.jpg', None, '33f8f102e28c454ebcf588361cd07ca3', '89002ec7445d46039ae0fb66720a3623', 5992496, 4, 'Arctic Circle', \"In the stunning frozen landscape of the Arctic Circle, David Blaine explores humanity's curiously extreme ability to endure freezing temperatures. He ... (37 characters truncated) ... ch beyond their limits to transform barriers into new frontiers and embody a sense of resilience, perseverance and grit that is unique to the region.\", '2025-03-30', 35, 7.5, 2, '/y52U2upxBnKTpIv40Z1tBcXPEA8.jpg', None, '304f999d82594137b26d9a636840b8c9', '89002ec7445d46039ae0fb66720a3623', 5992497, 5, 'South Africa', 'In a nation once defined by apartheid, David embarks on an epic adventure in South Africa, uncovering the magic of its diverse cultures and wildlife that is reshaping perceptions and dismantling barriers in this dynamic country.', '2025-04-06', 37, 7.0, 2, '/waMar4x8VYPN9PTd5VVG9aHSdZ.jpg', None, 'd23fbd1a57094f14a8e34b775cd67875', '89002ec7445d46039ae0fb66720a3623', 5992498, 6, 'Japan', 'From perfectly punctual bullet trains to meticulously assembled pieces of sushi, Japan is renowned for its craftsmanship, artistry and commitment to excellence in all endeavors. In Japan, David explores the concept of mastery by meeting with people who spend a lifetime refining a single skill.', '2025-04-06', 34, 8.0, 2, '/4fghpqoZSlZKEWyVNPzhQgq5QLK.jpg', None)"}
