{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:52.903107+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 49.27s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('4e3f6e5c2e7341a4979b362f9a399043', 'df8b95b95fbc4a9f889bb4ae4a8e3de8', 4835218, 1, 'Pilot', \"Dr. Oliver Wolf reluctantly accepts a job at Bronx General Hospital where he's forced to work with a team of interns as they treat a mother who can no longer recognize her children.\", '2024-09-23', 43, 5.375, 8, '/bIBKMyNQMNu4YTROtQZrnzq0l0Q.jpg', None, '3ef5564a29a140cb8fac437a1c112b25', 'df8b95b95fbc4a9f889bb4ae4a8e3de8', 5599987, 2, 'The Disembodied Woman', \"When a high school girls' basketball coach faces a debilitating illness, Dr. Wolf must help her reconnect with her body before it's too late. Ericka and Dana treat a frat boy who sees dragons.\", '2024-09-30', 43, 4.571, 7, '/r9Sp41kTEH5L6GTgGX6VlC0038E.jpg', None, '06ccb3fc4be34a01bb33351db7b2a0c7', 'df8b95b95fbc4a9f889bb4ae4a8e3de8', 5599988, 3, 'The Lost Biker', \"A member of a biker gang seeks out Dr. Wolf's help as he grapples with life-threatening memory loss. The interns are tasked to help a young girl struggling with mysterious seizures.\", '2024-10-07', 43, 5.667, 6, '/5hjg4XIeG4Pm7z4EBn7STn4xGrZ.jpg', None, 'd4b1cabb3431479b8e3a07f19d8b8532', 'df8b95b95fbc4a9f889bb4ae4a8e3de8', 5622998, 4, 'The Blackout Bride', 'When a bloody bride stumbles into Bronx General, Wolf races against the clock to save her and her missing husband. Ericka and Jacob fight to keep a John Doe patient in their care.', '2024-10-14', 43, 5.438, 8, '/hE506lydBGj3sSBr3ObUu0s28V9.jpg', None, 'ce87127b1eca44f89375c77dfa39b695', 'df8b95b95fbc4a9f889bb4ae4a8e3de8' ... 56 parameters truncated ... '/m5a8dsG8CAattg8W9VbKKIYtKQX.jpg', None, 'fc4beca404554e278e24ca8393e99c12', 'df8b95b95fbc4a9f889bb4ae4a8e3de8', 5770723, 10, 'The First Responder', 'An unexpected patient crashes into Bronx General with mysterious life-threatening symptoms.', '2024-12-02', 43, 5.8, 5, '/5bTZtacjru9eIcjtJFQqsAPTUHC.jpg', None, '7f632b65e5034bd09035f0fce056e6ae', 'df8b95b95fbc4a9f889bb4ae4a8e3de8', 5790367, 11, 'The Other Woman', 'Dr. Pierce treats a patient in crisis, presenting an ethical dilemma. Dr. Wolf and Dr. Nichols disagree on how to treat a patient.', '2024-12-09', 43, 5.667, 3, '/hwfzK59ajr0Yn2iSwwaS5FfCcVw.jpg', None, '34194cf3caa84a93825b06f7598e3a98', 'df8b95b95fbc4a9f889bb4ae4a8e3de8', 5821182, 12, 'The Doctor Whose World Collapsed', 'Dr. Wolf and his team face their biggest challenge yet when an apartment building collapses in the Bronx.', '2025-01-06', 43, 4.0, 5, '/rkgbu9PiKBdFkdoClrj3vcckMZw.jpg', None, 'dc50c5294e4e413c81ad7d1ddc0609d8', 'df8b95b95fbc4a9f889bb4ae4a8e3de8', 5822557, 13, \"The Man Who Can't See Faces\", 'Dr. Wolf meets a pastor dealing with mysterious visions. The interns grapple with the fallout from the building collapse.', '2025-01-06', 43, 3.333, 3, '/vVJKFEsY3nFF54op0fyZ5j4o9pq.jpg', None)"}
